.TH tkutlfind n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutlfind
.PP
Incremental find with match highlighting for a \fBtablelist\fR widget. Unlike a
filter, it highlights matching cells and steps through them. Complements
\fBtkutils::tkufilterbar\fR.
.SS Commands
.CS
::tkutils::tkutlfind::find    tbl query ?options?
::tkutils::tkutlfind::next    tbl
::tkutils::tkutlfind::prev    tbl
::tkutils::tkutlfind::matches tbl
::tkutils::tkutlfind::clear   tbl
.CE
.SS Options
.PP
\fB\-columns\fR (default all visible), \fB\-mode\fR substring|exact|glob|regexp,
\fB\-nocase\fR 0|1, \fB\-highlightbg\fR, \fB\-highlightfg\fR. \fBnext\fR/\fBprev\fR
cycle the matches, scrolling each into view.
.SS Example
.CS
bind .e <KeyRelease> { ::tkutils::tkutlfind::find .t $q }
bind . <F3>          { ::tkutils::tkutlfind::next .t }
.CE
.SS "Error codes"
\fB\-errorcode {TKUTILS TKUTLFIND <REASON>}\fR (MODE, OPTION).
.SH KEYWORDS
tablelist, find, search, highlight
